WEBVTT

01:28.145 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:36.825 --> 01:38.825
You think that beating me

01:40.025 --> 01:41.945
means you can rule the Lingbi Sect?

01:44.505 --> 01:46.585
You're celebrating way too soon.

01:47.505 --> 01:49.105
On the night of the full moon,

01:49.945 --> 01:51.465
the Ghost King returns to his tomb.

01:53.385 --> 01:55.945
If you want to end this before then,

01:57.665 --> 01:58.945
you'll have to kill me!

02:21.065 --> 02:22.105
Guards!

02:23.145 --> 02:24.345
Lock her up.

02:24.425 --> 02:25.465
-Keep her under strict watch!
-Understood!

02:58.665 --> 02:59.985
Zhong… Zhong Lin?

03:00.585 --> 03:01.825
Xiao Qianqing,

03:03.065 --> 03:04.585
things have come to a point

03:05.985 --> 03:08.185
that's far worse than we ever imagined.

03:08.785 --> 03:10.585
This is Aunt Chan's written confession.

03:10.665 --> 03:12.985
She blamed Princess Ying's death
on Du Tingxin,

03:13.065 --> 03:14.905
not the emperor.

03:14.985 --> 03:16.905
Because of that, everyone
from Xuanguang Hall was hunted down.

03:19.865 --> 03:21.145
After Mother's funeral,

03:22.305 --> 03:25.545
all the maids in Xuanguang Hall
were dismissed.

03:25.625 --> 03:26.745
I sent men to look into it.

03:26.825 --> 03:29.905
Those maids all died mysteriously.

03:30.425 --> 03:32.345
Only Aunt Chan
disappeared without a trace.

03:33.785 --> 03:36.425
She must have been poisoned and fled.

03:37.945 --> 03:39.705
But the poison still took her life.

03:41.865 --> 03:43.945
I found this letter on her body.

03:48.105 --> 03:50.945
The last witness is gone.

03:51.025 --> 03:51.945
Gone!

03:59.945 --> 04:01.225
There's also an eulogy

04:01.305 --> 04:03.225
the Empress Dowager
wrote for Princess Ying.

04:03.305 --> 04:08.505
I'LL REPAY YOU IN THE NEXT LIFE

04:10.865 --> 04:14.065
THE TENTH DAY OF THE SECOND MONTH
IN THE NINTH YEAR OF YONGXI

04:18.944 --> 04:20.384
The tenth day of the second month…

04:22.865 --> 04:24.785
That was the day before Ying died.

04:28.065 --> 04:29.905
When Ying was still alive,

04:31.265 --> 04:32.905
why was Mother already mourning her?

04:36.185 --> 04:37.225
Zhong Lin,

04:38.865 --> 04:40.385
the only explanation

04:41.505 --> 04:45.225
is that Mother knew Ying would die
and that she was involved.

04:51.145 --> 04:52.265
No, that can't be…

04:53.145 --> 04:55.305
She raised Ying herself.

04:56.225 --> 04:58.465
She… She could never kill her.

04:59.185 --> 05:00.265
Right?

05:02.345 --> 05:05.665
Then… why did Mother kill herself?

05:07.985 --> 05:10.905
Was it really just to force me
into rebellion?

05:10.985 --> 05:12.545
Your imperial brother

05:12.625 --> 05:15.505
tortured Princess Ying to death
and drove the Empress Dowager to suicide.

05:15.585 --> 05:17.145
I choose

05:17.225 --> 05:19.385
to back Your Highness for the throne.

05:20.545 --> 05:24.265
Du… Ting… Xin!

05:26.105 --> 05:30.145
So, Your Highness had been wary
of me all along.

05:40.825 --> 05:42.225
Tell me the truth.

05:43.185 --> 05:46.785
Did you push my mother to kill Ying?

05:47.865 --> 05:49.585
You already have all the evidence.

05:50.105 --> 05:51.345
Can you really not put it together?

05:53.345 --> 05:55.305
Then let me tell you.

05:56.865 --> 05:59.225
Xiao Huan drew the poisonous insect
out of Xiao Ying.

05:59.305 --> 06:01.865
Your mother then went
to see Princess Ying off.

06:01.945 --> 06:05.465
Except, she used Seven-Star Powder.

06:09.945 --> 06:14.985
Just a tiny dose of it
was enough to end her life.

06:17.505 --> 06:18.425
Mother…

06:18.985 --> 06:20.345
-My head hurts.
-So,

06:20.425 --> 06:21.865
-Ying!
-your mother

06:23.065 --> 06:25.305
personally killed Xiao Ying.

06:27.825 --> 06:28.905
Impossible!

06:30.785 --> 06:32.185
Basically, you have
only yourself to blame.

06:33.105 --> 06:34.225
Born into the imperial family,

06:34.305 --> 06:37.225
yet always putting on
that fake show of brotherly love.

06:37.825 --> 06:39.345
Naturally, your mother was angry.

06:40.425 --> 06:42.745
All her painstaking scheming was only

06:43.345 --> 06:45.585
to push you onto this throne.

06:46.345 --> 06:47.425
So…

06:49.545 --> 06:52.385
you goaded the Empress Dowager
into killing Princess Ying,

06:53.105 --> 06:54.745
then pinned it all on the Emperor,

06:55.865 --> 06:58.225
just to turn Prince of Yuzhang against him

06:58.985 --> 07:00.345
and force him into rebellion.

07:01.825 --> 07:02.785
Du Tingxin,

07:03.665 --> 07:05.585
what a vicious scheme!

07:08.345 --> 07:09.785
You flatter me.

07:09.865 --> 07:11.505
That little
three-birds-with-one-stone scheme

07:11.585 --> 07:13.585
even I must say was quite brilliant.

07:15.345 --> 07:18.025
Watching you all dance
in the palm of my hand…

07:18.585 --> 07:21.905
That feeling is simply delicious.

07:23.185 --> 07:24.025
Shut up.

07:27.545 --> 07:28.585
Shut up!

07:31.305 --> 07:34.065
My mother might hate His Majesty,

07:34.585 --> 07:36.305
but she'd never harm Ying.

07:38.465 --> 07:41.025
You're lying. You're lying!

07:45.265 --> 07:46.265
Fine, I'll tell you another truth.

07:46.865 --> 07:49.985
At first, she and I planned a fake death.

07:51.545 --> 07:55.305
Unfortunately for her,
why would I give her the antidote?

07:55.985 --> 07:59.465
Letting her pay for her own stupidity
is so much more fun.

08:00.105 --> 08:02.065
She wanted power in life
and a good name after death.

08:02.145 --> 08:05.385
All I did was help her fulfill that image

08:05.465 --> 08:07.105
of a devoted mother!

08:09.705 --> 08:10.705
You evil woman!

08:21.825 --> 08:23.545
Xiao Qianqing,

08:24.705 --> 08:28.145
do you still think
you and Xiao Huan are innocent?

08:29.065 --> 08:30.225
Xiao Huan can't even tell
right from wrong.

08:30.305 --> 08:33.345
He'd rather trust outsiders
and throw away all the loyalty I gave him!

08:33.904 --> 08:36.024
Empress Dowager Liu
is even more despicable.

08:36.105 --> 08:37.345
I only dropped a few hints,

08:37.425 --> 08:40.144
and she rushed over eagerly
to kill her own daughter!

08:40.225 --> 08:43.865
As for Xiao Ying,
blame her imperial birth,

08:44.465 --> 08:46.705
blame her ties to Xiao Huan and to you!

08:47.465 --> 08:49.825
But she's lived as a princess long enough.

08:49.905 --> 08:51.265
That's hardly a wasted life.

08:51.345 --> 08:53.985
Early or late, she'll be dead anyway.

08:54.585 --> 08:55.865
I'm evil?

08:56.545 --> 08:59.585
Why not blame your mother
for being ruthless and blinded by greed?

09:08.105 --> 09:08.985
Du Tingxin,

09:12.065 --> 09:15.065
Xiao Huan has always
treated you as his right hand,

09:15.865 --> 09:17.385
and he has never treated you badly.

09:18.185 --> 09:20.385
My mother and Ying

09:21.545 --> 09:23.585
have never done you any wrong.

09:25.945 --> 09:27.945
So, why are you so cruel?

09:28.705 --> 09:32.705
Today, since I heard
the truth from your own mouth,

09:33.465 --> 09:34.785
if I don't kill you,

09:35.985 --> 09:37.425
I don't deserve to live!

09:52.905 --> 09:53.905
Well?

09:55.465 --> 09:57.025
Are you going to rebel too?

09:59.705 --> 10:03.145
The show's over.
Time for the curtain to fall.

10:09.905 --> 10:11.665
Prince of Yuzhang
has colluded with a heretical sect

10:12.265 --> 10:13.265
and is plotting treason!

10:13.345 --> 10:16.065
Prince of Yuzhang is plotting treason!

10:16.145 --> 10:19.865
-Prince of Yuzhang is plotting treason!
-What exactly are you trying to do?

10:28.385 --> 10:30.665
Zhong Lin…

10:31.185 --> 10:33.545
She bears Heartbane.

10:33.625 --> 10:34.945
A princess
personally titled by His Majesty

10:35.705 --> 10:37.425
and future consort of Prince of Yuzhang

10:37.505 --> 10:39.385
turns out to be from the Lingbi Sect.

10:41.185 --> 10:42.665
How amusing.

10:43.345 --> 10:45.305
Are you still going to resist in vain?

10:45.905 --> 10:47.785
Why not kneel and beg me now?

10:48.385 --> 10:50.145
Maybe I'll even show you mercy.

10:51.665 --> 10:52.705
I,

10:53.865 --> 10:55.185
Prince of Yuzhang,

10:56.745 --> 11:00.025
am the only heir of the Xiao dynasty.

11:00.105 --> 11:01.185
Du Tingxin,

11:01.785 --> 11:03.065
think very carefully.

11:03.825 --> 11:06.865
If you kill me, what will happen to you?

11:08.545 --> 11:10.465
The only heir?

11:13.465 --> 11:15.385
You'd better think instead

11:16.145 --> 11:19.185
how to hand Great Qi over to me properly.

11:19.265 --> 11:20.825
Dream on!

11:33.905 --> 11:35.105
Let her go,

11:36.705 --> 11:37.625
and I'll give you…

11:39.305 --> 11:41.105
Xiao Qianqing, you're far too naive.

11:42.825 --> 11:44.745
What right do you have to bargain with me?

11:48.145 --> 11:49.065
-Zhong Lin…
-Move!

11:50.025 --> 11:51.665
-Xiao Qianqing!
-Zhong Lin!

12:12.585 --> 12:13.785
Xiao Huan…

12:15.265 --> 12:17.825
Now the whole Xiao clan is in my hands.

12:19.345 --> 12:20.545
Do you know

12:21.905 --> 12:23.465
how long I've waited

12:25.225 --> 12:26.425
for this very day?

12:31.305 --> 12:33.665
Lately, disasters
have kept striking Great Qi.

12:33.745 --> 12:37.265
So, I plan to hold
a Heaven-worship ceremony in three days

12:38.585 --> 12:41.465
to offer sacrifices
and welcome a new beginning.

12:42.665 --> 12:44.785
How dare you harbor such ambition!

12:44.865 --> 12:46.825
TAIJI HALL

12:46.905 --> 12:49.905
Offer sacrifice
and welcome a new beginning…

12:50.985 --> 12:52.425
What are you really after?

12:53.105 --> 12:56.265
Without a rightful emperor,
how can any ceremony be held?

12:57.265 --> 12:59.545
-Haven't you already guessed?
-You wouldn't dare!

13:02.545 --> 13:03.585
Why wouldn't I?

13:07.145 --> 13:08.425
Because…

13:11.945 --> 13:13.785
I also carry the Xiao bloodline.

13:15.185 --> 13:16.905
So, of course I can.

13:19.345 --> 13:20.185
Nonsense!

13:23.265 --> 13:25.905
That father-emperor you all revere
is nothing but scum.

13:26.865 --> 13:28.185
Xiao Huan is dead,

13:28.985 --> 13:29.825
and you

13:31.025 --> 13:33.665
are bound
by my Prison of Thousand Threads.

13:44.945 --> 13:46.345
Now, in the Xiao clan,

13:46.425 --> 13:49.105
only I can shoulder
the weight of this realm.

13:49.945 --> 13:50.825
Isn't that so?

13:51.345 --> 13:52.465
You…

13:53.785 --> 13:55.785
Once the ceremony is over,

13:55.865 --> 13:57.945
I'll return Zhong Lin to you.

13:58.705 --> 13:59.665
But by then,

14:00.385 --> 14:05.105
whether she'll still want to be
with a heartless puppet like you

14:05.825 --> 14:07.105
is another question.

14:23.385 --> 14:25.545
TAIJI HALL

15:01.825 --> 15:04.465
Do you think resisting
the Moon-Eclipse's fusion

15:05.585 --> 15:07.385
will keep it from eating you alive?

15:11.025 --> 15:12.825
You're celebrating way too soon.

15:13.545 --> 15:14.705
It's useless.

15:15.425 --> 15:17.825
Only I can undo
the Moon-Eclipse inside you.

15:18.425 --> 15:21.025
You'll never escape my grasp.

15:58.625 --> 16:02.585
Around 20 years ago,
were you ever in the Central Plains?

16:06.825 --> 16:08.385
Around 20 years ago,

16:08.945 --> 16:10.345
were you ever in Great Qi?

18:04.185 --> 18:06.185
You were soft-hearted toward your enemies.

18:06.265 --> 18:07.785
This is the price you pay!

18:09.345 --> 18:10.305
But you're my mother.

18:15.985 --> 18:19.225
Mother? Who are you calling your mother?

18:22.505 --> 18:24.305
Looks like the Moon-Eclipse

18:25.465 --> 18:26.705
has ruined your brain.

18:29.305 --> 18:31.465
I have nothing to do with you at all.

18:50.865 --> 18:53.065
The Moon-Eclipse in my body
is being dispelled…

18:53.665 --> 18:57.865
It's the king of poisons,
fed on the lifeblood of Saintesses.

18:59.145 --> 19:00.585
I'm using my inner force

19:01.745 --> 19:02.865
to help purge your poison.

19:21.385 --> 19:22.225
Why escaped?

19:26.025 --> 19:28.065
You don't want it removed?

19:30.425 --> 19:32.585
The Moon-Eclipse cannot be removed.

19:33.705 --> 19:34.545
Why not?

19:38.825 --> 19:43.145
Even if I have to endure
its torment forever,

19:43.225 --> 19:45.785
I can't let my mother
trade her life for mine.

19:51.625 --> 19:53.265
How do you know that?

19:53.905 --> 19:57.345
The Moon-Eclipse
was fed on a Saintess's lifeblood.

19:57.425 --> 19:58.705
There's no other way.

19:59.265 --> 20:02.065
And curing it
naturally means life for life.

20:04.505 --> 20:05.865
So you knew?

20:08.145 --> 20:09.825
You knew everything?

20:10.425 --> 20:11.465
Yes.

20:12.665 --> 20:15.705
I also know you've long regained
all your memories.

20:16.985 --> 20:18.545
You wouldn't acknowledge me

20:19.065 --> 20:21.705
because you'd already resolved
to sacrifice yourself

20:21.785 --> 20:23.105
to cure my poison.

20:26.065 --> 20:27.185
Mother,

20:28.065 --> 20:31.865
seeing you again
is life's greatest kindness to me.

20:34.065 --> 20:37.145
If curing the poison
means losing you again,

20:38.705 --> 20:41.225
I'd rather live my whole life with it.

21:00.465 --> 21:01.465
Huan,

21:03.505 --> 21:05.305
it's been 20 years.

21:08.185 --> 21:09.305
Have you been well?

21:09.385 --> 21:11.985
I've missed you so much.

21:13.225 --> 21:14.225
Mother,

21:15.345 --> 21:16.625
you finally accept me.

21:18.305 --> 21:19.585
Silly child…

21:22.385 --> 21:24.145
It's my fault

21:28.425 --> 21:31.185
you suffered so much.

21:33.785 --> 21:35.865
If I could start all over again,

21:37.665 --> 21:40.025
I would never let any of this happen.

21:52.945 --> 21:53.785
Twenty years ago,

21:54.825 --> 21:56.585
I wandered in the Central Plains.

21:58.065 --> 21:59.545
He saved my life.

22:00.625 --> 22:02.905
Back then, I had no idea
who he really was,

22:04.145 --> 22:05.865
so we traveled the martial world together.

22:07.025 --> 22:09.945
Not long after, I broke my sect's rules

22:10.865 --> 22:12.585
and pledged my life to him.

22:14.025 --> 22:15.305
He said he would marry me

22:16.425 --> 22:17.905
and take only me.

22:19.105 --> 22:20.145
But I never expected

22:21.185 --> 22:23.505
he was actually the Emperor of Great Qi.

22:23.585 --> 22:26.625
When I was carrying
his child, I was framed.

22:27.785 --> 22:31.465
My child was born with a cold illness.

22:32.225 --> 22:33.705
From that moment on,

22:34.585 --> 22:39.305
I had nothing but disappointment
in the palace and in your father.

22:40.865 --> 22:45.225
All I wanted was to leave the palace
and find a cure for your cold illness.

22:46.905 --> 22:50.185
But later, the Lingbi Sect's secret arts

22:50.265 --> 22:51.465
made me forget everything.

22:53.705 --> 22:54.905
So much has passed.

22:56.865 --> 22:59.505
One wrong step leads to another.

23:01.105 --> 23:02.105
With the late Emperor,

23:02.945 --> 23:05.465
our end was tragic,

23:06.585 --> 23:08.185
but my conscience is clear.

23:09.305 --> 23:10.585
Only with you,

23:11.585 --> 23:13.105
I failed to protect you,

23:15.225 --> 23:16.705
and that is my deepest regret.

23:23.265 --> 23:24.905
But I'm also relieved

23:26.425 --> 23:28.465
because you are far more courageous

23:29.345 --> 23:31.185
and responsible than I imagined.

23:35.705 --> 23:36.745
Huan,

23:38.785 --> 23:39.865
all these years,

23:40.985 --> 23:42.385
you've suffered so much.

23:44.585 --> 23:48.705
Mother, I'm not suffering.
I've been doing very well.

23:52.105 --> 23:54.105
You were born with this cold illness.

23:55.545 --> 23:58.265
Left alone in the palace,

23:59.705 --> 24:02.745
Empress Liu must've
tormented you in every way.

24:03.825 --> 24:05.225
You had no one to turn to.

24:05.985 --> 24:07.105
Just to protect yourself,

24:09.025 --> 24:11.225
you had to seek refuge
with Grand Tutor Ling.

24:13.025 --> 24:16.465
I can imagine how bitter and miserable

24:16.985 --> 24:18.745
that must have been.

24:21.425 --> 24:22.945
How could you be doing well?

24:27.465 --> 24:30.665
But now, I'm back.

24:33.545 --> 24:35.865
You don't have to bear it
all alone anymore.

24:36.465 --> 24:39.105
I know about Du Tingxin's rebellion.

24:39.905 --> 24:41.305
Leave it to me.

24:42.025 --> 24:42.985
Mother,

24:43.785 --> 24:46.425
this matter should still be handled by me.

24:47.985 --> 24:49.185
All these years,

24:50.145 --> 24:52.345
as the Saintess of the Lingbi Sect,

24:53.785 --> 24:54.785
I've done many wrongs.

24:57.225 --> 24:58.145
Huan,

24:58.745 --> 25:00.785
you should give me a chance

25:01.705 --> 25:02.985
to atone.

25:07.385 --> 25:08.425
Mother,

25:09.065 --> 25:11.025
you were trapped by their secret arts.

25:11.705 --> 25:14.265
None of this was what you truly wanted.

25:16.145 --> 25:17.145
Huan,

25:18.665 --> 25:20.465
are you hiding something from me?

25:24.505 --> 25:25.545
Du Tingxin has taken away

25:25.625 --> 25:27.025
all of the Heartbane
from the Heartless Willow.

25:27.865 --> 25:29.585
Since I made her Imperial Preceptor,

25:30.465 --> 25:33.545
it is my responsibility
to restore peace to Great Qi.

25:34.145 --> 25:36.825
You plan to unleash
the Moon-Eclipse's full power?

25:37.425 --> 25:38.825
You must not!

25:42.865 --> 25:43.825
Huan,

25:43.905 --> 25:45.785
your body simply can't take it.

25:46.545 --> 25:49.025
The Moon-Eclipse will shatter your heart
and invade your mind.

25:49.105 --> 25:50.945
Even if you keep your life,

25:51.025 --> 25:55.665
you'll lose your senses
and know only killing!

26:01.145 --> 26:02.105
Mother,

26:03.345 --> 26:04.505
I've already made up my mind.

26:12.425 --> 26:13.425
Huan,

26:14.025 --> 26:17.345
I know you carry Great Qi
and its people in your heart.

26:18.945 --> 26:19.785
But what about yourself?

26:25.145 --> 26:26.825
Have you ever thought of yourself?

26:45.025 --> 26:47.625
This elixir is refined from Ice Lotus.

26:49.305 --> 26:51.105
It can bring you back to life.

26:52.785 --> 26:53.985
It'll save your life

26:55.705 --> 26:57.185
in a critical moment.

27:06.345 --> 27:07.745
QI

27:07.825 --> 27:11.465
Madam, everything
for the ceremony is ready.

27:13.745 --> 27:16.505
Prince of Yuzhang and Zhong Lin
are both in my hands now,

27:17.465 --> 27:21.385
but that Ling Cangcang
keeps ruining my plans.

27:25.545 --> 27:28.745
And the ceremony
is the most important day of my life.

27:32.065 --> 27:33.185
Xiao Huan…

27:41.385 --> 27:42.505
How could I hold it

27:44.305 --> 27:46.425
without Her Majesty?

27:48.185 --> 27:51.305
We've spread the news
that Zhong Lin was captured.

27:51.385 --> 27:53.785
The Empress will show herself soon enough.

27:53.865 --> 27:55.305
-By then--
-But I can't wait another moment!

28:01.585 --> 28:03.545
Our dear Princess Zhong Lin

28:03.625 --> 28:08.105
was personally titled by His Majesty
and is the Empress's closest friend.

28:11.105 --> 28:13.585
Hang her on the city gate.

28:14.305 --> 28:16.065
Let's wait for Ling Cangcang

28:17.265 --> 28:18.785
to show up.

28:19.305 --> 28:21.385
Prince of Yuzhang has been bound
by Prison of Thousand Threads.

28:21.905 --> 28:23.305
And Princess Zhong Lin

28:23.385 --> 28:25.425
is accused of colluding
with the Lingbi Sect

28:25.505 --> 28:26.945
and displayed on the city gate.

28:35.785 --> 28:37.145
She knows I'll show up.

28:40.585 --> 28:41.865
Well, I'll do as she wishes.

28:41.945 --> 28:43.145
Your Majesty,

28:43.225 --> 28:45.985
they're doing this
just to lure you into their trap.

28:46.825 --> 28:50.145
Let's see who ends up in whose trap.

28:53.145 --> 28:56.745
SUQING GATE

29:06.225 --> 29:09.425
Even your imperial brother
can't possibly make it back alive!

29:19.225 --> 29:25.705
SUQING GATE

29:37.025 --> 29:38.465
Someone's rescuing her!

29:47.025 --> 29:48.625
Zhong Lin, are you all right?

29:49.425 --> 29:52.225
Go find Xiao Qianqing.
Tell him Xiao Huan is still alive.

29:55.465 --> 29:56.585
Go, now!

29:56.665 --> 29:57.705
We go together or not at all.

29:57.785 --> 29:58.745
Don't worry.

29:58.825 --> 30:00.145
I have my own plan.

30:00.225 --> 30:01.665
-Cangcang…
-Get her out of here!

30:01.745 --> 30:02.665
-Move!
-Cangcang…

30:02.745 --> 30:03.905
-Hurry!
-Cangcang!

30:08.145 --> 30:09.265
Cangcang!

30:40.185 --> 30:41.665
Madam, bad news!

30:43.305 --> 30:44.265
Speak.

30:45.305 --> 30:47.265
Ling Cangcang has rescued Zhong Lin.

30:47.345 --> 30:49.905
She also sent people
to raid the secret treasury.

30:50.665 --> 30:52.585
They robbed
the Lingbi Sect's funds and grain?

30:53.705 --> 30:55.545
Ling Cangcang is asking for death!

30:56.065 --> 30:57.705
-Find her.
-Yes.

31:07.585 --> 31:09.625
Your mother is dead. Your sister is dead.

31:09.705 --> 31:13.265
Even your imperial brother
can't possibly make it back alive!

31:13.825 --> 31:15.425
Anyone poisoned with this

31:15.505 --> 31:18.105
will slowly lose consciousness
within ten days.

31:18.705 --> 31:19.905
Tell me.

31:21.185 --> 31:22.545
Isn't that clever?

31:25.505 --> 31:26.585
Xiao Qianqing!

31:54.145 --> 31:54.985
Are you all right?

31:55.065 --> 31:57.225
It's just a scratch. It's nothing.

31:58.145 --> 31:59.985
What about you? How are you?

32:01.425 --> 32:02.385
I'm fine too.

32:04.985 --> 32:05.825
What is it?

32:06.425 --> 32:07.665
What happened to you?

32:09.025 --> 32:10.025
What's wrong?

32:11.065 --> 32:11.985
Take care.

32:21.225 --> 32:22.265
Zhong Lin…

32:24.785 --> 32:27.425
Lately, I keep dreaming about Xiao Huan,

32:29.265 --> 32:30.705
about when we were children.

32:33.065 --> 32:34.585
In the dream, he asks me…

32:37.385 --> 32:38.585
why I didn't trust him.

32:39.225 --> 32:40.905
No matter how I cry,

32:42.265 --> 32:43.505
apologize,

32:44.625 --> 32:46.025
and beg him not to go,

32:49.305 --> 32:52.105
he still throws himself
off Phoenix Terrace.

32:59.505 --> 33:01.545
I've never hated myself this much.

33:03.905 --> 33:07.345
I'm the killer…
I killed him with my own hands.

33:09.465 --> 33:12.345
No, you didn't. His Majesty isn't dead.

33:17.665 --> 33:19.025
What did you say?

33:19.105 --> 33:21.385
Cangcang told me. It's absolutely true.

33:24.665 --> 33:25.785
I knew it.

33:26.745 --> 33:28.945
There's no way he'd die that easily.

33:31.145 --> 33:33.585
He must be planning to strike back.

33:38.305 --> 33:39.745
When he returns…

33:40.785 --> 33:41.705
Prison of Thousand Threads…

33:42.785 --> 33:44.585
Du Tingxin planted it in you!

33:45.185 --> 33:46.465
She means to control you!

33:48.625 --> 33:49.585
Zhong Lin…

33:50.225 --> 33:51.945
It has already reached my heart.

33:53.345 --> 33:54.945
I'm afraid I'll hurt you.

33:58.305 --> 34:00.065
I once wanted you close,

34:01.345 --> 34:03.025
but now I'm setting you free.

34:04.185 --> 34:05.545
Go far away

34:06.505 --> 34:07.825
and never come back.

34:09.865 --> 34:10.985
You fool…

34:23.905 --> 34:24.744
Zhong Lin,

34:25.824 --> 34:27.505
I have one last request.

34:30.425 --> 34:31.425
Will you

34:32.985 --> 34:33.824
help me once more?

34:36.665 --> 34:38.665
Even a thousand times,

34:38.744 --> 34:40.824
I'd still say yes.

34:43.905 --> 34:44.945
All right.

35:21.345 --> 35:23.825
Greetings, Your Majesty.

35:24.625 --> 35:25.465
You've suffered too.

35:32.785 --> 35:33.905
Your Majesty,

35:34.825 --> 35:35.985
I came here

35:38.305 --> 35:39.665
to return this to you.

35:44.025 --> 35:46.825
I will not take back what I've given away.

35:55.425 --> 35:56.545
What are you going to do?

35:57.265 --> 35:59.385
The elite troops
from Southern Chu have arrived,

35:59.465 --> 36:00.545
waiting for my command.

36:01.945 --> 36:03.065
You want to kill Du Tingxin?

36:06.425 --> 36:07.945
You're under
the Prison of Thousand Threads.

36:08.025 --> 36:09.625
If you kill her, you'll die too!

36:09.705 --> 36:10.825
So what?

36:11.745 --> 36:12.745
There's my mother and Ying to avenge,

36:13.505 --> 36:14.785
and you as well.

36:16.545 --> 36:20.305
Even if it costs me my life,
I still have to kill her.

36:21.305 --> 36:22.185
Do you trust me?

36:29.505 --> 36:30.505
I do.

36:32.145 --> 36:35.185
Then don't act rashly. Leave this to me.

36:36.065 --> 36:38.505
I don't want you risking yourself again.

36:41.665 --> 36:45.225
What I've hated most
is being born imperial.

36:45.305 --> 36:48.705
I hate that you always outshine me, still.

36:50.825 --> 36:53.865
I hope we can be brothers
again in the next life.

36:54.905 --> 36:59.305
Next time, I'll be the older brother,
and I'll protect you.

37:13.505 --> 37:16.865
Madam, Fenglai Pavilion's
covert base should be here.

37:16.945 --> 37:18.545
But we couldn't find the entrance.

37:19.265 --> 37:21.345
They always act with great caution.

37:22.505 --> 37:24.745
On the surface,
it's an abandoned post station.

37:25.505 --> 37:28.705
But underground, there must be more to it.

37:29.465 --> 37:30.825
Search it.

37:30.905 --> 37:32.145
Yes, Madam! Search!

37:46.345 --> 37:47.505
Here's a secret tunnel!

37:58.505 --> 38:01.065
Out! Everyone out!

38:03.465 --> 38:04.305
Freeze!

38:05.385 --> 38:06.425
Move!

38:14.225 --> 38:15.345
Move!

38:15.945 --> 38:16.985
Bring them out.

38:17.065 --> 38:18.425
-Bring them out!
-Yes, sir!

38:21.385 --> 38:23.705
Your Majesty, it's been a while.

38:25.025 --> 38:27.265
You used to be so high and mighty.

38:27.345 --> 38:28.865
But without Xiao Huan,

38:28.945 --> 38:33.025
you're just a rat in the dark,
hiding from the sun.

38:35.225 --> 38:38.465
From the looks of it,
you're here to end it all?

38:39.025 --> 38:39.865
Go ahead.

38:43.465 --> 38:44.505
Ling Cangcang,

38:44.585 --> 38:47.545
you've fallen into my hands after all.

38:47.625 --> 38:50.625
The dignified Empress
has become my prisoner.

38:50.705 --> 38:52.985
You really do look quite pathetic.

38:53.985 --> 38:56.025
How does the torture feel?

39:04.065 --> 39:05.625
Kill me or torture me,

39:06.865 --> 39:07.785
do as you please.

39:12.025 --> 39:14.025
You're already my prisoner,

39:15.025 --> 39:16.345
yet you're still so defiant?

39:17.345 --> 39:19.145
I really want to see

39:19.225 --> 39:21.225
how long you can keep that mouth tough.

39:23.385 --> 39:27.065
Lately, I've discovered
a most interesting punishment.

39:27.825 --> 39:30.785
You'll be nailed up and burned
with incense for seven days,

39:30.865 --> 39:32.385
one stick a day.

39:33.425 --> 39:34.825
And on the seventh day,

39:36.025 --> 39:37.785
I'll reward you with an ice spike.

39:37.865 --> 39:39.025
If you're lucky,

39:39.905 --> 39:42.025
and it pierces your heart,
freezing your blood in its tracks,

39:42.105 --> 39:44.065
you'll be stuck between life and death.

39:45.865 --> 39:48.465
No… To be precise,

39:49.865 --> 39:51.985
you'll live like a walking corpse.

40:04.025 --> 40:05.385
With this lamp's effect,

40:05.985 --> 40:08.145
you'll bleed endlessly.

40:09.345 --> 40:10.585
But don't worry.

40:11.585 --> 40:13.265
Before the final day comes,

40:13.905 --> 40:15.345
I won't let you die.

40:18.785 --> 40:19.985
Come on then.

40:23.265 --> 40:24.425
Do it.

40:24.945 --> 40:25.905
Ling Cangcang,

40:25.985 --> 40:29.985
I don't care at all what you say now.

40:31.105 --> 40:32.745
Because you're in my hands.

40:33.665 --> 40:37.545
One day, you'll beg me
to grant you a quick death!

40:47.705 --> 40:48.545
Your Majesty,

40:49.505 --> 40:51.225
you'd better behave.

40:55.745 --> 40:58.505
Nail her up. Don't let her die.

40:59.305 --> 41:02.905
I still need her to witness
my moment of glory.

41:02.985 --> 41:04.105
Yes, Madam.

41:36.945 --> 41:38.305
Everyone,

41:39.705 --> 41:42.105
I am the Emperor of Great Qi, Xiao Huan.

41:48.745 --> 41:52.025
His Majesty is wise and mighty,
kind and benevolent.

41:52.105 --> 41:54.705
But we have committed grave sins
and must be punished.

41:54.785 --> 41:55.625
ONE WITH HEAVEN AND EARTH

41:55.705 --> 41:58.865
All sect members
shall serve five years of hard labor

41:59.465 --> 42:00.585
to atone for our crimes.

42:02.865 --> 42:05.265
We thank Your Majesty for your grace!

42:05.345 --> 42:09.145
From this day on,
the Lingbi Sect no longer exists.

42:09.825 --> 42:12.025
All of you must return to the right path,

42:12.825 --> 42:15.785
protect the weak, and uphold justice.

42:15.865 --> 42:19.465
From now on,
cut all ties with Nanrong Palace.

42:19.545 --> 42:21.865
No offender will be forgiven!

42:21.945 --> 42:22.985
Yes, Your Majesty!

42:35.585 --> 42:39.025
YAOQING HALL

42:39.105 --> 42:42.225
Lately, I've been busy with the ceremony

42:42.865 --> 42:44.705
and neglected Your Highness.

42:46.505 --> 42:47.825
My mistake.

42:53.705 --> 42:56.025
I heard you left your manor yesterday.

42:56.785 --> 42:58.265
Who did you meet?

43:03.945 --> 43:06.025
You think I had no way to deal with you?

43:17.705 --> 43:19.105
You still dare resist?

43:21.785 --> 43:24.105
Looks like the Prison of Thousand Threads

43:24.185 --> 43:26.185
are working slowly on you.

43:32.145 --> 43:33.385
Madam.

43:35.585 --> 43:36.625
Madam.

43:42.425 --> 43:44.625
-Madam.
-Madam, the Saintess has been deposed,

43:44.705 --> 43:46.185
and the Ghost King
now controls the Lingbi Sect.

43:48.705 --> 43:52.585
Seems this Ghost King
really is quite capable.

43:54.105 --> 43:54.945
He…

43:55.465 --> 43:56.745
He's actually…

43:57.345 --> 43:59.545
-Out with it!
-He is the Emperor of Great Qi.

44:01.905 --> 44:04.065
So, you really are still alive!
